<#f0f000>Movelist :</>

<#f0f000>Information:</>
Ghost can access <#ff0000>Toucon Boost Damashii</>
AKA Fighting Spirit Mode, this replaces normals
that use the Gan Gun Saber with the Sunglasseslasher,
allowing for more range and better spacing options.
It also gives access to the Ryoma Spirit as well
as buffing Lvl 1 Omega Drive.

<#f0f000>Basics:</>

Run					_F_F
Back Hop				_B_B
Super Jump				_D_U
Burst				^B+^C
(Requires 2000 Power)

Light Punch				^A
Strong Punch				^B
High Gan Gun Saber			^C
High Sunglasseslasher				^C
(Fighting Spirit)

Low Punch				^A (crouch)
Low Kick				^B (crouch)
Low Gan Gun Saber				^C (crouch)
(Knocks Down)
Low Sunglasseslasher				^C (crouch)
(Fighting Spirit, Knocks Down)

Air Punch				^A (air)
Air Kick				^B (air)
Air Gan Gun Saber				^C (air)
Air Sunglasseslasher				^C (air)
(Fighting Spirit, Dives down with Increasing Momentum)

Throw					[_B/_F]_+^C (When Close)

<#f0f000>Unique Moves:</>

Toucon Damashii Spirit Boost				^X
(Requires 1000 power, available if under 150 health or after
losing a round)

<#f0f000>Special Attacks:</>

Robin Hood Arrow				_D_DF_F^A
(Can be used in the air)

Thomas Edison Gun				_D_DF_F^B

Billy the Kid Triple-Blast				_D_DF_F^C

Naginata Slash				_D_DB_B^A

Musashi Cross-Slash				_D_DB_B^B

Benkei Slam				_D_DB_B^C
(First Attack is an Overhead)

Isaac Newton Attraction (Costs 500 Power)				_D_D^A
(Attacks the Corner of the other side of the screen,
does not effect opponents in hitstun)

Isaac Newton Repulsion				_D_D^B
(Causes wall-bounce, usable onle once per combo)

Ryoma Spirit				_F_DF_F^B
(Fighting Spirit)


<#f0f000>Lvl.1 Super Attacks:</>

Omega Drive				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A
Machine Ghost Striker				_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A
Boosted Horizontal Omega Drive				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A
(Fighting Spirit)

<#f0f000>Lvl.2 Super Attacks:</>

Grateful Damashii Omega Drive				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^B

<#f0f000>Lvl.3 Super Attacks:</>

Mugen Damashii Omega Drive				_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^C